{"id": "lg_elec-2026-07-23-007", "date": "2026-07-23", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lg_elec", "lg_display"], "customers": ["lg_elec"], "suppliers": ["lg_display"]}, "topics": ["oled_penetration", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.25, "keywords": ["increase", "loss"]}, "importance": {"score": 1.0, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "涉及財報", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "LG Display reports its financial results for Q2 2026, with a return to profitability thanks to strong OLED earnings", "content": "<p>LG Display reported its financial results for the second quarter of 2026, with a slight (1%) increase in revenue from the previous quarter to $3.8 billion, an EBITDA margin of 16%, and an operating loss of $73.5 million. That loss included a one-off expense due to workforce optimization and voluntary retirement programs, and without it the company would have generated an operating profit.</p><p><img src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/LG-Display-3rd-gen-tandem-OLE", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/lg-display-reports-its-financial-results-q2-2026-return-profitability-thanks", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-07-23-008", "date": "2026-07-23", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration", "mini_led"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["surpass"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Samsung unveils three new OLED foldables and the world's brightest smartwatch", "content": "<p>Samsung held its Galaxy Unpacked event in London yesterday, where it announced five new OLED devices: three foldable smartphones and two smartwatches. Between them, the new lineup introduces nine distinct OLED panels, some utilizing exciting new technologies. The lineup also includes the world's brightest smartwatch, surpassing even <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/garmin-launches-first-microled-smartwatch-round-14-4500-nits-display\">Garmin's microLED smartwatch</a>.</p><img src=\"https://ww", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/samsung-unveils-three-new-oled-foldables-and-worlds-brightest-smartwatch", "type": "rss"}]}
